# Blokbay module for Dolibarr (English, reference language)
Module530877Name = Blokbay
Module530877Desc = Customer invoices payable in USDC or USDT with a Blokbay payment link
BlokbayDescription = Customer invoices payable in USDC or USDT with a Blokbay payment link
BlokbayDescriptionLong = Adds a "Pay with Blokbay" button to validated customer invoices. The button creates a Blokbay invoice with the same lines, taxes and total, and the payment link appears on the invoice card, in the PDF and in the invoice email. When the customer pays, the signed webhook registers the payment on the bank account you choose and the invoice is classified paid.
BlokbaySetup = Blokbay settings
BlokbaySetupIntro = Create the API key and the webhook secret in your Blokbay panel, paste them here, then paste the webhook URL below in the Blokbay panel.
BlokbayApiUrl = API URL
BlokbayApiUrlHelp = Leave https://blokbay.com unless you test with another server.
BlokbaySecretKey = Secret key
BlokbaySecretKeyHelp = Starts with sk_live_. It is stored encrypted and never shown again: leave the field empty to keep the saved key.
BlokbayWebhookSecret = Webhook signing secret
BlokbayWebhookSecretHelp = Starts with whsec_. Leave the field empty to keep the saved secret.
BlokbayWebhookUrl = Webhook URL
BlokbayWebhookUrlHelp = Copy this URL in the webhook settings of your Blokbay panel. It must be reachable from the internet.
BlokbayBankAccount = Bank account for the payments
BlokbayBankAccountHelp = Blokbay payments are registered on this account (for example an account named "Stablecoins").
BlokbayPaymentMode = Payment method
BlokbayUserForActions = User for automatic payments
BlokbayUserForActionsHelp = The payments received by the webhook are registered with this user.
BlokbayAddToPdf = Add the payment link to the invoice PDF
BlokbayAddToEmail = Add the payment link to the invoice email
BlokbaySubstitutionHelp = In email templates and in the public note you can also use __BLOKBAY_PAY_URL__ (the link) or __BLOKBAY_PAY_TEXT_AND_URL__ (text and link).
BlokbayTestConnection = Test the connection
BlokbayTestOk = Connection to Blokbay works.
